---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Method | How Maxifi Digital Works | AEO"
  description="The Maxifi Digital method: Snapshot, Sprint, Engine. How we audit AI citation gaps, build structured visibility layers and track compounding citation lift."
  currentPage="/method"
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="method-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">THE MAXIFI METHOD</p>
    <h1 id="method-heading" class="page-h1">
      Three stages. Every engagement. No exceptions.
    </h1>
    <p class="page-lede">
      We don't guess what's wrong with your AI visibility. We measure it,
      build the fix, and track what moves — in that order.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       STAGE 1 — SNAPSHOT
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="stage" aria-labelledby="stage1-heading">
    <div class="stage-inner">
      <div class="stage-label-col">
        <p class="stage-num">01</p>
        <h2 id="stage1-heading" class="stage-title">Snapshot</h2>
        <p class="stage-sub">Free — 5 minutes</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stage-content">
        <p class="stage-intro">
          The Snapshot is a structured audit of your current AI citation footprint
          across five engines: ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Gemini and Google AI Overviews.
        </p>
        <div class="stage-points">
          <div class="sp">
            <p class="sp-head">What it measures</p>
            <ul class="sp-list" role="list">
              <li class="sp-item">Which AI engines mention your brand today</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Which buyer queries surface you — and which don't</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Which competitors are cited instead</li>
              <li class="sp-item">The structural gaps explaining the difference</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="sp">
            <p class="sp-head">What you get</p>
            <ul class="sp-list" role="list">
              <li class="sp-item">A 1-page written Snapshot report</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Your current citation score (0–100)</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Top 3 highest-leverage fixes</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Competitor citation comparison</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/visibility-snapshot" class="stage-cta">Run my free Snapshot →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       STAGE 2 — SPRINT
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="stage stage--alt" aria-labelledby="stage2-heading">
    <div class="stage-inner">
      <div class="stage-label-col">
        <p class="stage-num">02</p>
        <h2 id="stage2-heading" class="stage-title">Sprint</h2>
        <p class="stage-sub">From £4,500 · 30 days</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stage-content">
        <p class="stage-intro">
          The Sprint turns the Snapshot's findings into shipped assets. Answer-ready
          content, schema layers, Q&A pairs — everything needed to close the gaps the
          audit surfaced, within one month.
        </p>
        <div class="stage-points">
          <div class="sp">
            <p class="sp-head">What gets built</p>
            <ul class="sp-list" role="list">
              <li class="sp-item">30–60 Q&A pairs targeting buyer queries</li>
              <li class="sp-item">JSON-LD schema layer (FAQPage, Article, Service)</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Answer-ready landing pages or content updates</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Entity signal strengthening</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="sp">
            <p class="sp-head">How it runs</p>
            <ul class="sp-list" role="list">
              <li class="sp-item">Week 1: Audit + architecture</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Week 2: Q&A library + schema design</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Week 3: Build + client review</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Week 4: Launch + distribution</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/conference-aeo" class="stage-cta">Scope my Sprint →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       STAGE 3 — ENGINE
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="stage" aria-labelledby="stage3-heading">
    <div class="stage-inner">
      <div class="stage-label-col">
        <p class="stage-num">03</p>
        <h2 id="stage3-heading" class="stage-title">Engine</h2>
        <p class="stage-sub">From £5,000/mo · Ongoing</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stage-content">
        <p class="stage-intro">
          The Engine is a quarterly retainer that runs the Snapshot–Sprint cycle on
          repeat, with weekly citation monitoring between cycles. AEO authority
          compounds — each quarter widens the gap between you and competitors.
        </p>
        <div class="stage-points">
          <div class="sp">
            <p class="sp-head">What runs quarterly</p>
            <ul class="sp-list" role="list">
              <li class="sp-item">Full AI Visibility Snapshot (all 5 engines)</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Content Sprint — new assets targeting new gaps</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Schema + entity signal updates</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Monthly strategy call</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="sp">
            <p class="sp-head">What runs weekly</p>
            <ul class="sp-list" role="list">
              <li class="sp-item">Citation monitoring across all 5 engines</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Competitor citation tracking</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Monthly performance digest</li>
              <li class="sp-item">Cited Brief newsletter (for your team)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/visibility-engine" class="stage-cta">See the Engine →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       WHY THIS ORDER MATTERS
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--cream" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
    <p class="s-eyebrow">WHY THIS ORDER</p>
    <h2 id="why-heading" class="section-h2">Snapshot first. Always.</h2>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <p class="why-prose">
        Every AEO engagement we have ever seen go wrong started without a proper
        audit. Teams assumed their content was the problem. Or their schema. Or their
        competitor positioning. The Snapshot reveals which — and usually surfaces
        problems that would never have been guessed.
      </p>
      <p class="why-prose">
        It also creates a baseline. Citation lift without a pre-intervention baseline
        is just a story. With a Snapshot, every number in every client report
        is measurable, attributable and defensible.
      </p>
      <p class="why-prose">
        That's why we offer the Snapshot free. It's not a loss leader — it's the
        correct first move. And if the findings don't warrant a Sprint or Engine,
        we'll tell you that too.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
       CTA
  ══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="section section--pt0" aria-labelledby="method-cta-heading">
    <div class="cta-box">
      <p class="s-eyebrow cta-eyebrow">START THE METHOD</p>
      <h2 id="method-cta-heading" class="cta-title">
        Begin with the Snapshot. Everything else follows.
      </h2>
      <p class="cta-body">
        Free. 5 minutes. No sales call. The baseline that makes every next step
        worth taking.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/visibility-snapshot" class="btn-primary">Run my free Snapshot</a>
        <a href="/about#contact" class="btn-outline">Talk to us first</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--navy-deep) 100%);
    color: var(--blue-text);
    padding: 40px 22px 36px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: var(--fs-eyebrow);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--amber-mid);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .page-h1 {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    line-height: 1.18;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .page-lede {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--blue-soft);
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── Stages ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .stage {
    padding: 36px 22px;
    background: var(--cream);
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .stage--alt { background: var(--cream-deep); }

  .stage-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .stage-num {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--amber);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .stage-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }

  .stage-sub {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--mute-soft);
  }

  .stage-intro {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #444441;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .stage-points {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .sp-head {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--amber);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .sp-list { list-style: none; }

  .sp-item {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding: 3px 0;
    line-height: 1.4;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .sp-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .stage-cta {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid rgba(4, 44, 83, 0.2);
    display: inline-block;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .stage-cta:hover {
    color: var(--amber);
    border-color: var(--amber);
  }

  /* ── Why section ────────────────────────────── */
  .s-eyebrow {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--amber-mid);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .section-h2 {
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 30px 22px;
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .section--cream { background: var(--cream-deep); }
  .section--pt0 { padding-top: 0; }

  .why-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .why-prose {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ── CTA ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .cta-box {
    background: var(--navy);
    padding: 34px 22px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--blue-text);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .cta-eyebrow { color: var(--amber-mid); margin-bottom: 10px; }

  .cta-title {
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }

  .cta-body {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--blue-soft);
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: 0 auto 18px;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--amber);
    color: var(--amber-light);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { background: #854F0B; }

  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--blue-text);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-outline:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6); }

  /* ── Responsive ─────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-h1 { font-size: 24px; }

    .stage-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .stage-points { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cta-title { font-size: 18px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .btn-primary, .btn-outline, .stage-cta { transition-duration: 0.01ms; }
  }
</style>
